Space Cooler was added in '''Beta 36.0''' as a 2/6 monster with the ability to give +1/+1 to 2 random monsters in your hand at the end of every turn. Before its release, it was revealed with 7 HP instead. It shares this release change with [[Shrine Mascot]]. '''Beta 49.0''' gave it +1 ATK. '''Beta 54.1''' gave it another +1 ATK, but nerfed its effect to only give +1/+1 to 1 monster in your hand instead of 2.
[[File:Space Cooler (Beta 49.0).png|thumb|210x210px|Beta 49.0]]

